### Mini-IBE booking flow (IntelliJ HTTP client). Run the requests top to bottom - ids are chained automatically.

@host = http://localhost:8080/etraveli

### 1. Search flights (filter + sort + pagination). Stores the id of the first result.
GET {{host}}/flights?origin=ATH&destination=LON&passengers=2&sortBy=price&sortDir=asc&page=0&size=5

> {%
  client.global.set("flightId", response.body.items[0].id);
%}

### 2. Flight detail
GET {{host}}/flights/{{flightId}}

### 3. Create a booking for two passengers. Stores the booking reference and total.
POST {{host}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "flightId": {{flightId}},
  "contactEmail": "alex@example.com",
  "passengers": [
    { "firstName": "Alex", "lastName": "Papadopoulos", "dateOfBirth": "1990-04-12", "passportNumber": "AB123456" },
    { "firstName": "Maria", "lastName": "Papadopoulou", "dateOfBirth": "1992-09-30", "passportNumber": "CD654321" }
  ]
}

> {%
  client.global.set("reference", response.body.reference);
  client.global.set("totalAmount", response.body.totalAmount);
  client.global.set("currency", response.body.currency);
%}

### 4. View the booking (status CREATED)
GET {{host}}/bookings/{{reference}}

### 5. Pay - declined because the amount is too low (400, booking stays CREATED)
POST {{host}}/bookings/{{reference}}/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 1.00, "currency": "{{currency}}", "cardNumber": "4242424242424242" }

### 6. Pay the full amount (booking becomes CONFIRMED)
POST {{host}}/bookings/{{reference}}/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": {{totalAmount}}, "currency": "{{currency}}", "cardNumber": "4242424242424242" }

### 7. View the booking again (status CONFIRMED, payments listed)
GET {{host}}/bookings/{{reference}}

### 8. List bookings
GET {{host}}/bookings?status=CONFIRMED&contactEmail=alex@example.com&page=0&size=10

### 9. Cancel the booking (seats are released)
DELETE {{host}}/bookings/{{reference}}

### Negative cases

### Not enough seats: flight with 2-3 seats left, asking for more (400). Find one via GET /flights?origin=ATH&destination=STO
GET {{host}}/flights?origin=ATH&destination=STO&passengers=1

### Invalid sort field (400)
GET {{host}}/flights?sortBy=price;DROP

### Page size too large (400)
GET {{host}}/flights?size=1000

### Unknown booking (404)
GET {{host}}/bookings/ZZZZZZ
